# Styling & UI Engine
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4 (New CSS Engine)
- UI Engine: shadcn/ui with 'Base UI' (Headless)
- Design Strategy: Follow a Mobile-First responsive design strategy using Tailwind v4 utility classes.

# Icons Configuration
- Icons: Hugeicons React (@hugeicons/react) ONLY.
- Search and use Hugeicons Pro library first. Use Lucide icons only as a fallback if no suitable Hugeicon exists.